-- Seed history for store screenshots.
--
-- Progress, levels, badges and streaks are all computed on-device from
-- WorkoutSession rows, so a believable listing needs a believable history
-- behind it rather than a staged screen. Ten weeks of riding, rising power
-- over that span, and an unbroken run up to today so the streak card has
-- something to say.
--
-- Dates are relative to when this runs (strftime('%s','now')), so the
-- fixture never goes stale. startTimeEpoch is epoch MILLISECONDS.
--
-- Applied by scripts/capture_store_screenshots.ps1 against a debug install.
-- Never run this against a real rider's database.

DELETE FROM WorkoutTelemetry;
DELETE FROM WorkoutSession;

